  "question": {
    "text": "Methylation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of benzene gave <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of toluene. Calculate the percentage yield of toluene (Nearest integer)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "78",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>HCl</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gm</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>78</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>92</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>gm</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math>Percentage&nbsp;yield of toluene =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Actual</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>yield</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Theoretical</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>yield</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>920</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>"
